Package: openpanel
Title: Interactive Spectral Flow Cytometry Panel Builder
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Paul", family = "Heisig", email = "pkheisig@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8529-7944"))
Author: Paul Heisig [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8529-7944>)
Maintainer: Paul Heisig <pkheisig@gmail.com>
Description: Build and inspect spectral flow cytometry panels with packaged
    theoretical spectra. The browser interface supports Aurora, FACSDiscover,
    ID7000, and Attune Xenith cytometers and reports detector overlap,
    fluorophore similarity, and panel complexity.
URL: https://github.com/pkheisig/openpanel
BugReports: https://github.com/pkheisig/openpanel/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
